{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>早上7時07分，警方接獲一名男子報案指，其妻子在油麻地文英街25號文景樓寓所，持刀企圖自殺及傷害嬰孩。警員接報到場，穿著戰術背心及持盾牌上樓調查，經勸解後成功控制女事主，事後將她送院治理。事件中無人受傷，警方正調查事故原因。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:43:55.594691+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:13:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:14.025262+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:37:27.608768+00:00","content_hash":"2e96865aaec356347a2eaff12dc5ea6c2eb57138f009829f8b63c93c08fdbec6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:43:55.594691+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}